      "stableId": "math2-2006-q08",
      "sourceYear": 2006,
      "subjectCode": "math2",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "questionNumber": 8,
      "stem": "设 f (x ) 是奇函数，除 x = 0 外处处连续，x = 0 是其第一类间断点，则 $\\int _ { 0 } ^ { x } f ( t ) \\mathrm { d } t$",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "value": "连续的奇函数"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "value": "连续的偶函数"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "value": "在 x 0间断的奇函数"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "value": "在 x 0间断的偶函数"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "answerStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "explanation": "解. 应选 (B)．由题设知 f (x ) 在任意区间 [a,b ] 上都可积，故 $F ( x ) = \\int _ { 0 } ^ { x } f ( t ) \\mathrm { d } t$ 处处连续．又\n\n$$\nF (- x) = \\int_ {0} ^ {- x} f (t) \\mathrm{d} t = - \\int_ {0} ^ {- x} f (- t) \\mathrm{d} t = \\int_ {0} ^ {x} f (s) \\mathrm{d} s = F (x),\n$$\n\n则F(x)为偶函数",
      "explanationStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "reviewStatus": "needs_human_review",
      "finalizationStatus": "blocked",
