          "label": "C",
          "value": "−ln 2 − 1"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "value": "ln 2 − 1"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "answerStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "explanation": "解. 应选 (C)．由复合函数求导法则有 $h ^ { \\prime } ( x ) = g ^ { \\prime } ( x ) \\mathbf { e } ^ { 1 + g ( x ) }$ ．将 x = 1 代入上式得$1 = 2 \\mathbf { e } ^ { 1 + g ( 1 ) }$ ．解得 $g ( 1 ) = \\ln { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } - 1 = - \\ln 2 - 1$",
