      "questionNumber": 16,
      "stem": "（本题满分10分）\n\n求 $\\int { \\frac { \\arcsin \\mathbf { e } ^ { x } } { \\mathbf { e } ^ { x } } } \\mathbf { d } x .$",
      "options": [],
      "answer": null,
      "answerStatus": "missing",
      "explanation": "解. 由换元积分法和分部积分法，可得\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int \\frac {\\arcsin \\mathrm{e} ^ {x}}{\\mathrm{e} ^ {x}} \\mathrm{d} x = \\int \\frac {\\arcsin \\mathrm{e} ^ {x}}{\\mathrm{e} ^ {2 x}} \\mathrm{d} (\\mathrm{e} ^ {x}) = \\int \\frac {\\arcsin t}{t ^ {2}} \\mathrm{d} t = - \\int \\arcsin t \\mathrm{d} \\left(\\frac {1}{t}\\right) \\\\ = - \\frac {\\arcsin t}{t} + \\int \\frac {\\mathrm{d} t}{t \\sqrt {1 - t ^ {2}}} = - \\frac {\\arcsin t}{t} + \\int \\frac {t \\mathrm{d} t}{t ^ {2} \\sqrt {1 - t ^ {2}}} \\\\ = - \\frac {\\arcsin t}{t} + \\frac {1}{2} \\int \\frac {\\mathrm{d} (1 - t ^ {2})}{(1 - t ^ {2}) \\sqrt {1 - t ^ {2}} - \\sqrt {1 - t ^ {2}}} = - \\frac {\\arcsin t}{t} + \\frac {1}{2} \\int \\frac {\\mathrm{d} (u ^ {2})}{u ^ {3} - u} \\\\ = - \\frac {\\arcsin t}{t} + \\int \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{u ^ {2} - 1} = - \\frac {\\arcsin t}{t} + \\frac {1}{2} \\ln \\left| \\frac {u - 1}{u + 1} \\right| + C \\\\ = - \\frac {\\arcsin e ^ {x}}{e ^ {x}} + \\frac {1}{2} \\ln \\left| \\frac {\\sqrt {1 - e ^ {2 x}} - 1}{\\sqrt {1 - e ^ {2 x}} + 1} \\right| + C. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$",
      "explanationStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "reviewStatus": "needs_human_review",
      "finalizationStatus": "blocked",
      "knowledgePoints": [],
      "anomalies": [],
